00:39:50,056 --> 00:39:54,027
>> MOLLY.

1854
00:39:57,097 --> 00:39:59,699
>> DON'T FALL APART, MOLLY.

1855
00:39:59,699 --> 00:40:00,467
I'M GONNA START BY

1856
00:40:00,467 --> 00:40:02,602
TAKING THAT THING OFF YOUR HAIR.

1857
00:40:02,602 --> 00:40:03,470
AND YOU'RE GONNA WORK

1858
00:40:03,470 --> 00:40:04,738
WITH WHAT MAMA AND DADDY MADE.

1859
00:40:04,738 --> 00:40:05,839
>> (chuckles)

1860
00:40:05,839 --> 00:40:06,606
>> OKAY?

1861
00:40:06,606 --> 00:40:07,607
BUT THAT DOESN'T MEAN

1862
00:40:07,607 --> 00:40:08,642
THAT THE PICTURES ARE

1863
00:40:08,642 --> 00:40:09,709
GONNA GET ANY BETTER

1864
00:40:09,709 --> 00:40:10,744
BECAUSE OF THAT.

1865
00:40:10,744 --> 00:40:11,645
IT HAS TO COME

1866
00:40:11,645 --> 00:40:12,712
FROM INSIDE OF YOU.

1867
00:40:12,712 --> 00:40:13,747
CONGRATULATIONS.

1868
00:40:13,747 --> 00:40:14,481
>> THANK YOU.

1869
00:40:14,481 --> 00:40:15,715
>> YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING

1870
00:40:15,715 --> 00:40:16,550
TOWARDS BECOMING

1871
00:40:16,550 --> 00:40:17,617
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1872
00:40:17,617 --> 00:40:18,685
>> THANK YOU SO MUCH.

1873
00:40:18,685 --> 00:40:19,953
>> YOU'RE WELCOME.

1874
00:40:19,953 --> 00:40:21,555
>> (crying)

1875
00:40:21,555 --> 00:40:23,557
>> YOU HAVE SO MUCH EXPERIENCE

1876
00:40:23,557 --> 00:40:24,591
ALREADY.

1877
00:40:24,591 --> 00:40:25,292
>> I--

1878
00:40:25,292 --> 00:40:26,159
>> YOU'VE WALKED, LIKE,

1879
00:40:26,159 --> 00:40:27,527
FASHION WEEK IN L.A. AND STUFF.

1880
00:40:27,527 --> 00:40:28,461
>> I KNOW.

1881
00:40:28,461 --> 00:40:29,396
>> THESE GIRLS

1882
00:40:29,396 --> 00:40:30,230
HAVEN'T DONE THAT.

1883
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:31,498
BUT THE STRENGTH HAS TO COME

1884
00:40:31,498 --> 00:40:32,432
FROM INSIDE,

1885
00:40:32,432 --> 00:40:33,199
'CAUSE YOU KNOW

1886
00:40:33,199 --> 00:40:34,167
THE REAL WORLD OF MODELING IS

1887
00:40:34,167 --> 00:40:35,202
EVEN CRAZIER THAN "TOP MODEL."

1888
00:40:35,202 --> 00:40:36,169
>> IT IS. MM-HMM. (sniffles)

1889
00:40:36,169 --> 00:40:37,437
>> RIGHT? OKAY. GIVE ME A HUG.

1890
00:40:37,437 --> 00:40:39,673
>> THANK YOU, TYRA.

1891
00:40:39,673 --> 00:40:40,574
I CAN'T BELIEVE

1892
00:40:40,574 --> 00:40:41,908
THIS PARTICULAR SHOOT

1893
00:40:41,908 --> 00:40:44,177
WAS THE REASON WHY I WENT HOME.

1894
00:40:44,177 --> 00:40:45,278
THIS TIME I WAS

1895
00:40:45,278 --> 00:40:46,446
THINKING WAY TOO MUCH,

1896
00:40:46,446 --> 00:40:49,816
AND DOUBTING MYSELF AS WELL.

1897
00:40:49,816 --> 00:40:50,717
IT'S THE WORST FEELING,

1898
00:40:50,717 --> 00:40:52,185
KNOWING THAT YOU WON'T BE ABLE

1899
00:40:52,185 --> 00:40:53,053
TO CONTINUE ON

1900
00:40:53,053 --> 00:40:53,987
AND SHOW THAT YOU HAVE

1901
00:40:53,987 --> 00:40:56,223
SO MUCH MORE TO GIVE.

1902
00:40:56,223 --> 00:40:57,257
BUT YOU KNOW WHAT?

1903
00:40:57,257 --> 00:40:59,226
I LET MYSELF GET IN MY WAY,

1904
00:40:59,226 --> 00:41:01,061
AND I'M ALMOST EMBARRASSED,

1905
00:41:01,061 --> 00:41:02,929
BUT I'M STILL PROUD OF MYSELF.

1906
00:41:02,929 --> 00:41:04,898
I STILL MADE IT TO THE TOP NINE.

1907
00:41:04,898 --> 00:41:08,101
BYE.

1908
00:41:08,101 --> 00:41:11,304
♪♪♪♪♪

1909
00:41:14,107 --> 00:41:17,978
